# MarketStream Cloud

## Project Overview
A cloud-based market intelligence platform that helps users decide which stocks to buy/sell.

## Tech Stack
- **Backend**: Python / FastAPI
- **Frontend**: Angular + Chart.js
- **Database**: NoSQL (future milestone)
- **Deployment**: Google Cloud Run
- **Testing**: pytest + FastAPI TestClient (backend), Angular test runner + Playwright (frontend)

## Development Process
Follow strict TDD: write tests FIRST (RED), then implement (GREEN), then refactor (REFACTOR).

## Backend Structure
backend/
  app/         - FastAPI application code
    api/       - Route handlers
    models/    - Pydantic data models
    services/  - Business logic
  tests/
    unit/      - Unit tests per feature
    integration/ - API integration tests

## Coding Standards
- All functions must have type hints
- All modules must have docstrings
- Tests must be written before implementation (TDD)
- Keep services stateless; no side effects in pure logic functions
